{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, <strong>idle medieval inn and town management game</strong> that thrives while you're doing your stuff. Dock it at the bottom of your screen, grow your tavern into a lively town, and keep the ale flowing.  <br><br><strong>Build, Brew &amp; Belong.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tidehaven: Ale &amp; Trade</i> is a cozy yet authentic medieval inn <strong>management &amp; automation &amp; design</strong> game designed to fit your day. Dock it at the <strong>bottom of your screen</strong> and let your tavern hum along while you work or jump in to micromanage rush hours, strike shady deals, and expand a sleepy inn into a lively town. <br><br><strong>From Inn to a Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and <strong>grow room by room</strong>: kitchen, bedroom, market, stable,<strong> a secret meeting room for under-the-table trades</strong>, and more. Grow your village beyond the inn, build <strong>stable</strong>, <strong>butcher</strong>, <strong>blacksmith</strong> and more to <strong>shape your town</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/11f22ac763cea68732886cfa28120071.poster.avif?t=1768994550\" width=488 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/11f22ac763cea68732886cfa28120071.webm?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/11f22ac763cea68732886cfa28120071.mp4?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Customize everything </strong><br> <br> Unlock <strong>tons of decor</strong> and decorate your space in any style you like, you can even paint each tile on the floor! And some of these decoration items have a surprising bit of lore and <strong>buff system</strong> too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/591ff2b527074aa2d9010cd910f0f663.poster.avif?t=1768994550\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/591ff2b527074aa2d9010cd910f0f663.webm?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/591ff2b527074aa2d9010cd910f0f663.mp4?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy medieval vibe </strong><br><br>Set between the 15th-17th centuries, Tidehaven pairs crackling hearths and clinking tankards with a <strong>medieval-to-lo-fi</strong> soundtrack that makes time drift by. Strengthen your economy while expanding your tavern in most fashion way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.poster.avif?t=1768994550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.webm?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.mp4?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this game something for you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Docked \u201cbottom-of-screen\u201d mode</strong> for effortless second-screen play sound appealing?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn to town</strong>: Do you enjoy developing your place in your own style and discovering different mechanics and dynamics with each new building?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let staff automation &amp; supply chains</strong> that keep the ale (and coins) flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore tons of stylish decor</strong> and <strong>perk-granting items</strong> to style and optimize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try side events &amp; mini-games</strong> that spice up your routine with risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets?</strong> Oh, we like pets. Name your <strong>dog</strong>, breed<strong> horses</strong>, and if you\u2019re lucky keep a rare <strong>parrot</strong> in your room too. <strong>Fishing</strong>? Hmm\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/55b2e7f91cc144f6a5077498f954b4c9.poster.avif?t=1768994550\" width=494 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/55b2e7f91cc144f6a5077498f954b4c9.webm?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/55b2e7f91cc144f6a5077498f954b4c9.mp4?t=1768994550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And here is <strong>no punishing gameplay</strong> with constant difficulties that need perfect planning. Faster, chiller, relaxing, min-maxing, <strong>every way is a right way here</strong>. No plague carts, no witch hunts, no non-stop raids! Put your fireplace, take a fresh ale, and do a little automation.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re here for <strong>cozy decorating</strong> and \u201colden days\u201d vibes or for <strong>laid-back economic tinkering</strong>, your story begins in Tidehaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691420?t=1768994550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/0bc17d7b4c2a459da75610e40c2da244273b5d6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768994550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/c7dc2da0dc9c7754db57f7d8fbfbcf47aa7a3f5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768994550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/c7dc2da0dc9c7754db57f7d8fbfbcf47aa7a3f5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768994550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4251150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, <strong>idle medieval inn and town management game</strong> that thrives while you're doing your stuff. Dock it at the bottom of your screen, grow your tavern into a lively town, and keep the ale flowing.  <br><br><strong>Build, Brew &amp; Belong.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tidehaven: Ale &amp; Trade</i> is a cozy yet authentic medieval inn <strong>management &amp; automation &amp; design</strong> game designed to fit your day. Dock it at the <strong>bottom of your screen</strong> and let your tavern hum along while you work or jump in to micromanage rush hours, strike shady deals, and expand a sleepy inn into a lively town. <br><br><strong>From Inn to a Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and <strong>grow room by room</strong>: kitchen, bedroom, market, stable,<strong> a secret meeting room for 